      "role": "user",
      "content": "makes sense. how do we handle the edge cases for the employees who are constantly losing things or leaving their keys in weird places? we need a protocol for when someone loses their key or if it somehow gets stolen. what's the best practice for revoking access and getting them back online without creating a massive security hole?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
